# --- Vendored third-party runtime (fetched, never committed) ---
# `python tools/fetch_vlc.py` puts the VLC/libvlc runtime here. It is 80 MB
# of someone else's LGPL/GPL binaries with its own licence file; the repo
# pins the version and the SHA-256 instead of carrying the bytes.
vendor/

